APPEND CARRID TO ..
CITY_FR = 'SCRUBBED_STRING'.
AT SELECTION-SCREEN ON SO_DEPT.
IF ( SO_DEPT-LOW GT 'SCRUBBED_STRING' OR SO_DEPT-HIGH GT 'SCRUBBED_STRING' ) AND CITY_FR EQ 'SCRUBBED_STRING'.
  MESSAGE E046 ( BCTRAIN ).
ENDIF.
